ad#:~:text=Glissa%20confronted%20the%20mysterious%20individual%20orchestrating%20the%20attacks","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Slobad","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Slobad","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Slobad#:~:text=Glissa%20confronted%20the%20mysterious%20individual%20orchestrating%20the%20attacks","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Slobad\", section \"Glissa\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"the-darksteel-eye-e3","summary":"Memnarch rebuffs Pontifex's offer to become part of him, and Pontifex blames Glissa and begins going insane.","participants":["pontifex","memnarch","glissa"],"location":"panopticon","importance":"major","page":"wiki/the-darksteel-eye","order":1589,"story_date":"","storyline":"Mirrodin Cycle","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":9,"quote":"He interprets this as Glissa being responsible for his god abandoning him, and starts going insane.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/The_Darksteel_Eye#:~:text=He%20interprets%20this%20as,and%20starts%20going%20insane.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"The Darksteel Eye","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/The_Darksteel_Eye","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/The_Darksteel_Eye#:~:text=He%20interprets%20this%20as,and%20starts%20going%20insane.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"The Darksteel Eye\", section \"Pontifex\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"the-darksteel-eye-e5","summary":"With Janus dead, Pontifex ascends to leadership of the Synod.","participants":["pontifex","janus","orland"],"location":"vedalken","importance":"major","page":"wiki/the-darksteel-eye","order":1589,"story_date":"","storyline":"Mirrodin Cycle","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":10,"quote